I've just setup a Digital Unix box as a NIS and DNS server (both secondary
servers), when an SGI (IRIX 5.2) or a SunOS (4.1) machine tries to get
hostname information from this server it fails to refer to the DNS maps.
and only sees the hosts named in the NIS hosts file. 

